# Root .dockerignore — Railway/Docker build context is the repo root
# (see railway.toml). Keeps the context small and deterministic: none of
# these are read by any COPY instruction in packages/core/Dockerfile, but
# without this file Docker still uploads them to the daemon on every build
# (measured: packages/agent/.venv 320M, packages/core/.venv 377M, plus a
# root-level node_modules/ for the frontend — none of it used by the build).

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
.git/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
